on file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'Jano gaž wobkšuśiśo nagrawanje za tykac abo drastwu, kótaraž njejo na WordPress.org: kuždu dataju .php a .js, kuždu dataju block.json a readme.txt, readme.md, style.css a theme.json w głownem zapisniku togo komponenta, ako zip, pó tom až dataje, kótarež wótpowěduju zwucnym tajnym datajam, su se wuwostajili.','Open Babilim settings'=>'Nastajenja Babilim wócyniś','Original language'=>'Originalna rěc','Original string'=>'Originalny rěśazk','Paid'=>'Płaśony','Partner'=>'Partner','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Pšosym kontrolěrujśo, lěc Wašo sedło jo z interneta dostupne, a wopytajśo hyšći raz.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Wubjeŕśo pšosym kategoriju za toś tu rozpšawu.','Plugin'=>'Tykac','Plugin · %s'=>'Tykac · %s','Plugins'=>'Tykace','Preview'=>'Pśeglěd','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Nakup jo wótnowjony. Toś to sedło jo něnto licencowane.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'Licba znowa analysěrowanych zapisow njejo wótpowědowała natwarjonemu indeksoju.','Re-verify'=>'Hyšći raz pśeverificěrowaś','Rebuild index now'=>'Indeks něnto znowa twóriś','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Pisanje zwenka zapisnika rěcnych datajow Babilim se wótpokazujo.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'W wótegronje registracije su trjebne póla felowali.','Registration restarted.'=>'Registracija jo se znowa startowała.','Remove'=>'Wótwónoźeś','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'Wšykno wótstraniś, což jo Babilim instalěrował','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Wšykno wótstraniś, což jo Babilim instalěrował? Toś to wulašujo wšykne rěcne dataje, kótarež jo Babilim za kuždy tykac a kuždu drastwu na toś tom sedle instalěrował.','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'Pśełožk komponenty %1$s do rěcy %2$s z toś togo sedła wótpóraś?','Removed %d installed component.'=>'Wótwónoźona %d instalěrowana komponenta.' . "\0" . 'Wótwónoźonej %d instalěrowanej komponenśe.' . "\0" . 'Wótwónoźone %d instalěrowane komponenty.' . "\0" . 'Wótwónoźonych %d instalěrowanych komponentow.','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Wótpórany pó njewuspěšnej kontroli integrity','Removed.'=>'Wótwónoźone.','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'Wótstroni wšykne rěčne dataje, kótarež jo Babilim za kuždy tykac a kužde drastwy na toś tom sedle instalěrował.','Report a problem'=>'Problem k wěsći daś','Report translation'=>'Pśestajenje k rozpšawjenju','Request newer translation'=>'Nowšy pśełožk pominaś','Request translation'=>'Pśełožk pominaś','Requestable'=>'Dajo se napominaś','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Gaž pśełožk pominaš, se toś ten tykac abo toś ta drastwa pśipokazujo na jadno z městnow licheje słužboweje pakšyny za toś to sedło (limit jo %1$d za drastwy a %2$d za tykace), mimo gaž južo jadno městno ma. Městno wóstanjo wužywane a njewuspěšny pśełožk jo njewóswobóźijo.','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'Gaž pśełožk pominaš, se toś ten tykac abo toś ta drastwa pśipokazujo na jadno z městnow licheje słužboweje pakšyny za toś to sedło, mimo gaž južo jadno městno ma. Městno wóstanjo wužywane a njewuspěšny pśełožk jo njewóswobódźijo.','Requesting…'=>'Pomina se…','Restart registration'=>'Registrěrowanje znowa startowaś','Restore code'=>'Kod wobnowjenja','Restore purchase'=>'Nakup wobnowiś','Retry request'=>'Napominanje znowa wopytaś','Roll back'=>'Slědk wrośiś','Roll back and report'=>'Slědk wrośiś a k wěsći daś','Roll back and send report'=>'Wótwrośiś a rozpšawu pósłaś','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'Pśełožk %2$s za %1$s na pjerwjejšny build wótwrośiś?','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Slědk stajony a k wěsći dany.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Na pjerwjejšny build slědk stajony.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Slědk stajony, ale rozpšawa njejo se mógała pósłaś: %s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Wótwrośenje by \'%1$s\' (%2$s) pśepisało, kótaraž se něnto za drugu instalowanu komponentu dostawa (%3$s); nic njejo se změniło.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'W wótegronje wuměny tokena jo site_token felował.','Save changes'=>'Změny składowaś','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Planowany, caka na pśeźěłanje','Search'=>'Pytaś','Search components'=>'Komponenty pytaś','Search the installed translations'=>'Instalowane pśełožki pytaś','Select all'=>'Wšykne wubraś','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Wubjeŕśo mjenjej komponentow: maksimalnje %1$d operacijow na běg (sćo wubrali %2$d).','Send report'=>'Rozpšawu pósłaś','Service plan'=>'Słužbny plan','Settings'=>'Nastajenja','Share error reports'=>'Rozpšawy wó zmylkach źěliś','Share this report'=>'Toś tu rozpšawu źěliś','Show a new restore code'=>'Nowy kod wobnowjenja pokazaś','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'Zapisk „Pśestajenje zdźěliś“ w rědowej lejsće administratora pokazaś','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'Dypk teksta toś teje komponenty jo wót awtora direktnje do koda zapisany a njedajo se pśez rěcny pakśik pśełožyś.','Status'=>'Status','Status unknown'=>'Status njejo znaty','String context'=>'Kontekst znamuškowego rjeśazka','Suggested translation'=>'Pśedpórany pśełožk','Supplementary translation index'=>'Dopołnjujucy indeks pśełožkow','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Indeks dopołnjujucych pśełožkow jo se znowa natwarił.','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Wótwardowanje dopołnjujucego indeksa pśełožkow','Supplementary translations'=>'Dopołnjujuce pśełožki','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Wucyśenje pśetrjete, bźez togo až by se nješto wósyrotniło: %s.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Wucyśenje dokóńcone: %d dataja wulašowana.' . "\0" . 'Wucyśenje dokóńcone: %d dataji wulašowanej.' . "\0" . 'Wucyśenje dokóńcone: %d dataje wulašowane.' . "\0" . 'Wucyśenje dokóńcone: %d datajow wulašowanych.','Sweep now'=>'Nětko wucyśćiś','Sync complete.'=>'Synchronizacija jo dokóńcona.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Źěkujomy se. Waša rozpšawa jo se pósłała.','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Ta komponenta njejo na toś tom sedle instalowana, togodla njedajo se pśełožk za nju pominaś.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'To njewuglěda ako kod wobnowjenja.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'To njejo płaśiwy kod WordPress-rěcnego regiona. Nic njejo se składowało.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'To njejo płaśiwy identifikator buildu.','That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list.'=>'Toś ten wobraz za nagraśe jo był zestarjony: pózdźej jo se druge nagraśe pśigótowało. Nic njejo se pósłało. Pśeglědaj aktualne nagraśe z Lisćiny pśełožkow.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'Změna njejo se dała w indeksu pśełožkow zapisaś; pšosym wopytajśo hyšći raz.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'Wucyśenje jo se wuwjadło, ale někotare jogo změny njejsu se mógli w indeksu pśełožkow zapisaś; pśiducy wucyśenje buźo je znowa wopytowaś.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'Komponent njama žedne dataje, kótarež daju se nagraś.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Komponenta njejo we zarědniku tykacow abo drastwow.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Głowna dataja komponenty njejo se namakała.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'W wótegronje śěgnjenja jo wužywajobne městno felowało.','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'Zapisk wócynja panel, w kótaremž móžoš pśełožki pytaś, kótarež jo Babilim na toś tom sedle instalěrował, a jaden z nich zdźěliś.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'Pólo „%1$s“ jo pśedłujke: ma %2$d znamuškow a limit jo %3$d. Nic njejo se pósłało; skrośćo jo a wopytajśo hyšći raz.','The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'Licha słužbowa pakšyna dajo kuždemu sedłoju wobgranicowanu licbu městnow za tykace a drastwy; wužywane městna se w nastajenjach pokazuju, gaž Babilim zmóžnijoš.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Pódana domena \'%1$s\' njewótpowěduje ani swójskemu slugoju \'%2$s\' paketowego manifesta ani jogo text_domain \'%3$s\'.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'Zjadnośony indeks za \'%s\' jo se znowa twórił, ale indeks pśełožkow njejo mógał jen zapisaś; pśiducy twórjenje buźo wopytowaś znowa.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Originalny tekst a pśełožki, kótarež su z njogo nastali, se staje drugim sedłam k dispoziciji, kótarež instalěruju samsku wersiju.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Paket njedeklarěrujo žednu głownu pśełožkowu dataju.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Paket njama %s za swójsku tekstowu domenu.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Družina \'%1$s\' paketowego manifesta njewótpowěduje pominanej družinje \'%2$s\'.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Pakśik njejo wutwórił žednu głownu pśełožkowu dataju, kótaraž by se dała k dispoziciji stajiś.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Tekstowa domena \'%1$s\' paketa njewótpowěduje kopiji komponenty na toś tom sedle (\'%2$s\'), togodla paket njejo se instalěrował.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Zapakowana komponenta njejo se dała cytaś.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Registrěrowańske wuzwanje njejo w wócakanej formje.','The report could not be sent.'=>'Rozpšawa njejo se dała pósłaś.','The search could not be completed.'=>'Pytanje njejo se dalo dokóńcyś.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'Słužba jo toś to sedło pominała, aby pócakało, nježli znowego synchronizěrujo.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Słužba njejo mógła Waše sedło dojśpiś. Firewall, wěstotny tykac abo pšawidło hostera nejskerjej napšašowanje blokěrujo; pšosym dowólćo napšašowanja na /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Póbitowanje za nagraśe wót słužby njejo było dopołne.','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'Tekstowa domena \'%1$s\' (%2$s) se južo za drugi instalěrowany komponent pósrědnja (%3$s); nic njejo se instalěrowało.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'Nagraśe se wobchowujo až do togo, až Babilim popšosyśo, aby jo wulašował.','Theme'=>'Drastwa','Theme · %s'=>'Drastwa · %s','Themes'=>'Drastwy','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Žedno nagraśe njejo w běgu.','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Žedno nagraśe njceka na wobkšuśenje.','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'How su rěcy, kótarež toś to sedło wužywa. Móžośo je w %s změniś.','These fields will be sent:'=>'Toś te pola se pósćelu:','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Toś ten build toś to sedło tuchylu njeznajo za toś tu komponentu/rěc.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Ta komponenta njedeklarěrujo wersijowy numer, togodla njedajo se pśełožk za nju pominaś.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Toś ta komponenta jo wětša, ako słužba akceptěrujo, a togodla njedajo se nagraś.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Ta komponenta jo se južo nagrała. Babilim ju něnto pśespytujo.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Wersijowy numer toś teje komponenty jo dlejšy ako %d znamuškow, což Babilim njamóžo wobźěłaś, togodla njedajo se pśełožk za nju pominaś.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'To wudawa nowy kod wobnowjenja a pjerwjejšny kod pśestanjo funkcioněrowaś. Pókšacowaś?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Toś ta sieś ma pśewjele sedłow, aby se wšykne jadnotliwje kontrolěrowali, a někotare móžo byś nastajone, aby swóju identitu Babilim wulašowali, gaž se tykac wulašujo. Płaśona licenca, kótaraž jo z takim sedłom zwězana, njedajo se pótom awtomatiski wobnowiś; musyśo se na Pomoc Babilim na %s wobrośiś. Aby identity zachowali, klikniśo na Pśetergnuś, wótwólśo kokulku pód „Wšykne Babilim-daty pśi wótinstalěrowanju lašowaś“ w nastajenjach Babilim kuždego sedła a deaktiwěrujśo hyšći raz. Tekrajkuli deaktiwěrowaś?','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'Wersija toś togo tykaca, aby było słužbje móžno Wam pokazaś, až ma se aktualizěrowaś, jolic jo za komunikaciju pśestara.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Toś ta rozpšawa njenamjeńjujo płaśiwu tykaturu abo drastwu a rěc.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Toś ten rapoŕt njepódawa mě instalěrowaneje znamjeńskeje rjeśazki.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Toś ta rozpšawa njejo z płaśiwym buildom zwězana.','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'Toś ta rozpšawa se zjawnje na GitHub wózjawi a móžo se wót tśeśich wobchowaś.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Toś ten kod wobnowjenja njejo se za toś te sedło spóznał.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Toś to sedło ma južo aktiwne registrěrowanje, kótarež njedajo se wěcej awtomatiski wobnowiś.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Toś to sedło ma %1$d komponentow w %2$d rěcach, což pótrjebujo %3$d kontrolowych dawkow; Babilim móžo maksimalnje %4$d na běg wobźěłaś. Zmjeńšćo zastojane rěcy w nastajenjach abo deaktiwěrujśo njewužywane tykace a drastwy, a klikniśo pótom něnto na Hyšći raz kontrolěrowaś.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Toś to sedło nima nakupa, za kótaryž se dajo kod pokazaś.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Toś to sedło jo južo licencowane. Zacytajśo bok znowa.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Toś to sedło njejo hyšći pla Babilim registrěrowane.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Toś to sedło pśekšacujo wjelikosć, kótaruž słužba w jadnom synchronizěrowanju akceptěrujo, a tak su se někotare elementy wuzamknuli: %1$d komponentow a %2$d rěcnych wariantow.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Toś to sedło jo źěl multisite-seśi, kótaraž nowe pśełožki awtomatiski njeinstaluju. Južo instalowane pśełožki se pak dalej aktualizěruju.','This site is verified.'=>'Toś to sedło jo pśeverificěrowane.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Toś to sedło musy se nejpjerwjej pśespytowaś.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'URL toś togo sedła, aby słužba mógła pśeglědowaś, až wam słuša.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Adresa toś togo sedła jo pśedłujka, aby ju Babilim registrěrował.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Konfigurěrowany rěcny kod toś togo sedła.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Kod rěcy toś togo sedła njejo kod, kótaryž Babilim registrěrowaś móžo.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Toś ten znamjenjowy rjeśazk njedajo se z toś togo sedła rozpšawiś.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Toś ta znamjeńska rjeśaz njejo mjazy pśełožkami instalěrowanymi na toś tom sedle. Pytajśo hyšći raz a wubjeŕśo ju z lisćiny.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'Toś ten pśełožk jo se wót wašogo pytanja aktualizěrował. Pytajśo hyšći raz a wubjeŕśo znamjeńsku rjeśaz z nowej lisćiny.','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Aby se toś ten komponent pśełožył, trjeba Babilim jogo žrědło.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Pśewjele wopytow. Wopytajśo jutš hyšći raz.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Źinsa jo było pśewjele rozpšawow. Wopytaj jutštychu hyšći raz.','Too many requests.'=>'Pśewjele napšašowanjow.','Toolbar'=>'Rědowa lejsta','Translating…'=>'Pśełožujo se…','Translation does not load'=>'Pśełožk se njezacytajo','Translation failed'=>'Pśełožowanje njejo se raźiło','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Pśełožkowe dataje, kótarež stajaśo do %s, maju pśecej pśednosć pśed datajami Babilim. Wóstanu zachowane, snaźkuli njewótwólijośo toś to kontrolowe pólo.','Translation requested.'=>'Pśełožk jo se pominał.','Translations'=>'Pśełožki','Type'=>'Typ','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Zapódajśo nanejmjenjej 2 znamušce za pytanje.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Njewócakowana HTTP-wótegrona %d.','Uninstall'=>'Wótinstalowaś','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Njeznaty typ: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Njewěsta domena: %s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Njebezpjecny rěcny kod: %s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Njebezpjecny slug: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'Njebezpjecny text_domain: %s','Update'=>'Aktualizěrowaś','Update available'=>'Aktualizacija k dispoziciji','Updates'=>'Aktualizacije','Updating…'=>'Aktualizěrujo se…','Upgrade this site'=>'Licencu toś togo sedła pówušyś','Upload and request'=>'Nagraś a požedaś','Upload cancelled.'=>'Nagrawanje pśetergnjone.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Nagraśe dokóńcone – pśełožk jo se pominał.','Upload expired before it finished'=>'Nagraśe jo spadnuło, nježli až jo se dokóńcyło','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'Nagraśe běžy — pókšacowaś abo pśetergnuś','Upload this component?'=>'Toś ten komponent nagraś?','Upload was not accepted'=>'Nagraśe njejo se akceptěrowało','Uploading'=>'Nagrawa se','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Nagrawa se źěl %1$d z %2$d…','Uploading…'=>'Nagrawa se…','Verified'=>'Pśeglědowany','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'W wótegronje pśekontrolěrowanja jo site_token felował.','Version %s'=>'Wersija %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Což se sćelo, gaž Babilim aktiwěrujoš','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Gaž se we Babilim něco njezgótowa, pósćel rozpšawu wó zmylku k słužbje Babilim, aby se mógła ako zjawne pśipowěsćenje na GitHub wózjawiś. Rozpšawa se pósćele, ako by pśišła z toś togo sedła, ze samskeju awtentifikaciju ako kužde druge napšašowanje k słužbje Babilim. Słužba wózjawi jano kod zmylka a wersije ako zjawne pśipowěsćenje na GitHub; zjawne pśipowěsćenje njewopśimjejo adresu sedła, wopśimjeśe ani datajowe puśe. Standard: wušaltowane.','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Źo sćo to wiźeli (opcionalne)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'Gaž jo toś to zašaltowane, se pśełožki, kótarež słužba za zarědowane rěcy nalicyjo ako k dispoziciji stojece, pśi dwójnem synchronizěrowanju na źeń instalěrowaju.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Za toś ten kontekst wopaki','Wrong meaning'=>'Wopacny zmysł','Wrong plural form'=>'Wopacna pluralowa forma','Wrong term'=>'Wopacny termin','Yes'=>'Jo','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Njesmějośo to cyniś.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Wersija wašogo PHP za kompatibelnosć.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Waša wersija WordPress, aby słužba mógła kompatibelne pśełožowańske dataje k dispoziciji stajiś.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Twój nowy kod wobnowjenja: %s. Wobchowaj jen na wěstem městnje — pjerwjejšny kod wěcej njefunkcioněrujo.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'Twója rozpšawa se awtomatiski pśez modele AI pśeźěła a móžo toś ten pśełožk za druge sedła pólěpšyś.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Waše sedło jo wótegronilo, ale njejo wótegronilo tak, kaž se wócakujo. REST API se snaź wót drugego tykaca pśepisujo abo se toś ten endpoint pufrujo; pšosym wuzamknjśo /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge z pufrowanja a pśepisowanja.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Waše sedło jo pśedłujko trało z wótegronom. Pšosym wopytajśo pózdźej hyšći raz a kontrolěrujśo, lěc waš host njejo pśepómały abo pśeśěžony.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip njama manifest.json.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'W zip felujo wócakowana standardna dataja: %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'W zip felujo wócakowana dataja: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json ma njewócakanu strukturu','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'_manifest.json njejo se dał cytaś: %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest felujo abo ma njepłaśiwe \'%s\'.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'\'server_build_id\' w expected_manifest njejo płaśiwy build id.','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'Njejo se raźiło _manifest.json parsowaś: %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'by %1$d z %2$d zastojanych komponentow wósyrjeło (wěcej ako połojca)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'kužda zastojana komponenta %1$s by se wósyrjonym zapiskom stała (%2$d z %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'Licba zapisow l10n.php njewótpowěduje za %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json ma njepłaśiwe \'default_domain_entries\'.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json ma njepłaśiwe \'default_domain_files\'.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'manifest.json w zipje njejo płaśiwy JSON.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json felujo abo ma njepłaśiwe \'%s\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json felujo abo ma njepłaśiwe \'build_no\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json felujo abo ma njepłaśiwe \'entries\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json felujo abo ma njepłaśiwe \'extra_domains\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json felujo abo ma njepłaśiwe \'files\'.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'\'%s\' w manifest.json njewótpowěduje wócakowanej gódnośe.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'\'contract\' w manifest.json njejo płaśiwy wersijowy znamuškowy rjeśazk.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'\'kind\' w manifest.json musy byś \'plugin\' abo \'theme\'.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'\'server_build_id\' w manifest.json njejo płaśiwy build id.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'\'status\' w manifest.json musy byś \'published\'.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce musy hexadecimalny znamjenjowy rjeśazk byś.','per day'=>'na źeń','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'sha256 njewótpowěduje za %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'sha256 njewótpowěduje za default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'tykac','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'drastwa','problem report categoryOther'=>'Druge','translation statusAvailable'=>'K dispoziciji','translation statusInstalled'=>'Instalěrowany','Babilim translation turned off.'=>'Babilim-přełožk jo se wupónuł.','Stop using Babilim translation'=>'Babilim-přełožk wěcej njewužywaś','Use Babilim translation'=>'Babilim-přełožk wužywaś','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the theme\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Babilim-přełožk drastwy %1$s (%2$s) wěcej njewužywaś? WordPress buźo město togo swójski přełožk drastwy abo WordPress.org-přełožk wužywaś. Móžośo kuždy cas slědk pśejś.','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the plugin\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'Babilim-přełožk tykaca %1$s (%2$s) wěcej njewužywaś? WordPress buźo město togo swójski přełožk tykaca abo WordPress.org-přełožk wužywaś. Móžośo kuždy cas slědk pśejś.','Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes'=>'Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes','Enjoying Babilim? Please leave a rating on WordPress.org.'=>'Se wam Babilim spódoba? Wóstajśo pšosym pógódnośenje na WordPress.org.','Rate Babilim'=>'Babilim pógódnośiś','Babilim translation bundled with the theme'=>'Babilim-pśełožk, kótaryž jo w drastwje wopśimjety','Babilim translation bundled with the plugin'=>'Babilim-pśełožk, kótaryž jo w tym tykaśu wopśimjety','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, the languages it already includes, and which of those bundled translations Babilim generated (language codes only). For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'Za kuždy instalěrowany tykaś a kuždu drastwu: jogo mě (slug), wersija, text domain, lěc jo na WordPress.org nalicony, rěcy, kótarež južo wopśimujo, a kótare z tych wopśimjetych pśełožkow jo Babilim napórał (jano direktowe kody rěcow). Za kuždy instalěrowany Babilim-pśełožk: kótaru wersiju ma, kej jo se slědny raz kontrolěrował a lěc jo jogo kontrola dataje wuspěšna była.']];